<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>🦑 Squid Game | PORTAL</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;700;900&display=swap');
        
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        
        body {
            background: #0a0a1a;
            color: white;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            position: relative;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(233,69,96,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%),
                radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 0%, transparent 70%);
        }
        
        .hero::before {
            content: '○ △ □';
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            right: 30px;
            font-size: 2em;
            color: rgba(233,69,96,0.1);
            letter-spacing: 15px;
        }
        
        .logo {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 4em;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e94560, #ff6b81);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            animation: glow 2s ease-in-out infinite;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        @keyframes glow {
            0%, 100% { filter: brightness(1); }
            50% { filter: brightness(1.5); }
        }
        
        .subtitle {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: #aaa;
            letter-spacing: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        
        .server-ip {
            background: rgba(233,69,96,0.1);
            border: 2px solid #e94560;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.5em;
            color: #ff6b81;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }
        
        .btn-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        
        .btn {
            padding: 15px 35px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1em;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
        }
        
        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e94560, #ff6b81);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(233,69,96,0.4);
        }
        
        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(233,69,96,0.6);
        }
        
        .btn-soon {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 15px 35px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1em;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            background: rgba(233,69,96,0.08);
            border: 2px dashed rgba(233,69,96,0.3);
            color: rgba(233,69,96,0.5);
            cursor: default;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .btn-soon-badge {
            background: #e94560;
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 0.65em;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            animation: badgePulse 1.5s infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes badgePulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.6; }
            50% { opacity: 1; }
        }
        
        .section {
            padding: 80px 20px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .section-title {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2em;
            text-align: center;
            color: #e94560;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
        }
        
        .games-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }
        
        .game-card {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1e1e4a, #16213e);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid rgba(233,69,96,0.2);
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .game-card:hover {
            border-color: #e94560;
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(233,69,96,0.2);
        }
        
        .game-icon { font-size: 3em; display: block; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .game-name { font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .game-desc { font-size: 0.85em; color: #aaa; }
        
        .stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        
        .stat-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1e4a, #2a1a3e);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid rgba(233,69,96,0.2);
        }
        
        .stat-number {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2.5em;
            color: #ff6b81;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.8em;
            color: #aaa;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }
        
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(233,69,96,0.1);
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.8em;
        }
        
        .links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .links a {
            color: #e94560;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        
        .links a:hover { color: #ff6b81; }
        
        .links .link-soon {
            color: rgba(233,69,96,0.3);
            cursor: default;
            text-decoration: line-through;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .logo { font-size: 2.5em; letter-spacing: 4px; }
            .subtitle { font-size: 0.9em; letter-spacing: 5px; }
            .server-ip { font-size: 1.1em; padding: 10px 20px; }
            .section-title { font-size: 1.5em; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="hero">
        <div class="logo">SQUID GAME</div>
        <div class="subtitle">Выживает сильнейший</div>
        <div class="server-ip">🌍 185.169.134.5:7777</div>
        <div class="btn-group">
            <a href="https://t.me/SquidGameBEST_bot" class="btn btn-primary">🦑 ИГРАТЬ В БОТЕ</a>
            <div class="btn-soon">
                <span>💬 DISCORD</span>
                <span class="btn-soon-badge">СКОРО</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">🎮 МИНИ-ИГРЫ</div>
        <div class="games-grid">
            <div class="game-card">
                <span class="game-icon">🟢</span>
                <div class="game-name">Красный свет — Зелёный свет</div>
                <div class="game-desc">Беги на зелёный, замри на красный!</div>
            </div>
            <div class="game-card">
                <span class="game-icon">🍬</span>
                <div class="game-name">Сахарные соты</div>
                <div class="game-desc">Вырезай фигуру, не сломав соты!</div>
            </div>
            <div class="game-card">
                <span class="game-icon">🎲</span>
                <div class="game-name">Кости</div>
                <div class="game-desc">Угадай чёт или нечет — удвой монеты!</div>
            </div>
            <div class="game-card">
                <span class="game-icon">🔢</span>
                <div class="game-name">Угадай число</div>
                <div class="game-desc">От 1 до 100 за 7 попыток!</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">📊 СТАТИСТИКА</div>
        <div class="stats">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number">500+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Игроков</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number">10.000+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Игр сыграно</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number">50.000+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Монет выдано</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        <div class="links">
            <a href="https://t.me/SquidGamePortalBot">🤖 БОТ</a>
            <a href="https://t.me/GameSquidMy">📢 КАНАЛ</a>
            <span class="link-soon">💬 DISCORD</span>
            <a href="https://vk.ru/bestrussiaonlinerp">🔵 VK</a>
        </div>
        <p>© 2026 Squid Game | PORTAL. Все права защищены.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:5px;">○ △ □</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
